  "remarks": "LLC Slavneft-Krasnoyarskneftegaz is a Russian company active in the energy sector, in particular in the Krasnoyarskiy Kray. LLC Slavneft-Krasnoyarskneftegaz engages in oil refining, and is part of the structure of PJSC Slavneft. The energy sector, especially the oil and gas sectors, provides a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, LLC Slavneft-Krasnoyarskneftegaz is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
